## Recommended model catalog: one-line notes (keys come from resources/model-catalog.json).

model-catalog-note-nllb600m-main14-ccm-int4 = Default. Pruned vocabulary, 14 languages, int4. Non-commercial use only.

model-catalog-note-nllb600m-un6-ccm-int4 = Pruned vocabulary, the six UN languages, int4. Non-commercial use only.

model-catalog-note-opusmt-en-zh-int4 = English to Chinese, int4. Small and quick.

model-catalog-note-opusmt-zh-en-int4 = Chinese to English, int4. Small and quick.

model-catalog-note-hymt2-1-8b-int4 = Tencent Hy-MT2 1.8B, int4. Optional, not picked automatically.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv6-tiny-cd609a1 = Smallest and fastest, for low-end machines. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv6-small-463ea9f = Default. Good balance of speed and accuracy. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv6-medium-f5063c6 = Highest accuracy of the v6 line, larger and slower. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv5-small-7b2a75a = Previous generation, mobile models. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv5-medium-7b2a75a = Previous generation, server models. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv4-small-7b2a75a = Older generation, mobile models. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ppocrv4-medium-7b2a75a = Older generation, server models. Three files: detector, recognizer, dictionary.

model-catalog-note-ocr-runtime-1-0-8 = Runtime needed by every OCR model. Extract it into the runtimes folder next to the models folder.

model-catalog-note-stt-zh-streaming-default = Chinese, streaming, default.

model-catalog-note-stt-zh-streaming-alternate = Chinese, streaming, alternate.

model-catalog-note-stt-en-streaming-default = English, streaming, default.

model-catalog-note-stt-en-streaming-alternate = English, streaming, alternate.

model-catalog-note-stt-bilingual-streaming-default = Chinese and English, streaming, default.

model-catalog-note-stt-bilingual-streaming-alternate = Chinese and English, streaming, alternate.

model-catalog-note-stt-bilingual-streaming-legacy = Chinese and English, streaming, legacy.

model-catalog-note-stt-zh-offline-default = Chinese, offline, default. Needs the Silero VAD file as well. Redistribution terms not verified, check them yourself before use.

model-catalog-note-stt-zh-offline-alternate = Chinese, offline, alternate. Needs the Silero VAD file as well. Redistribution terms not verified, check them yourself before use.

model-catalog-note-stt-en-offline-default = English, offline, default. Needs the Silero VAD file as well.

model-catalog-note-stt-en-offline-alternate = English, offline, alternate. Needs the Silero VAD file as well.

model-catalog-note-stt-bilingual-offline-default = Chinese and English, offline, default. Needs the Silero VAD file as well.

model-catalog-note-stt-bilingual-offline-alternate = Chinese and English, offline, alternate. Needs the Silero VAD file as well.

model-catalog-note-silero-vad = Voice activity detection file, required for offline models. Put it directly in this folder, not in a subfolder.

model-catalog-note-slanet-plus = Table structure model (SLANet plus, ONNX), a single file.

model-catalog-note-rapid-latex-ocr = Formula recognition. Download all four files from the release page and put them together in this folder.
